<template name="config-menu__audio">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__wrapper">
                <div class="config-debug">
                    <div class="config-debug__scroll">
                        <div class="config-debug-option" data-if="aud_changed">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div style="flex: 1 1 0dp; width: 100%; white-space: normal;">Changed settings apply when the game is next launched.</div>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Music</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Randomize Music</div><div class="config-tip-text">On shows the game's 44 music tracks below, each with what plays in its place: click a name to choose a file from the custom_music folder next to the game (jingles pick from the fanfares folder), or use the Randomise all buttons - Custom only fills every track from the folders, Game's own shuffles the game's own music between its slots, Mix draws each track from either. Choices apply straight away; Preview starts the track now and Stop preview goes back. q64music.exe next to the game converts .ootrs packs and MIDI files, and custom_music.txt beside the settings says what was loaded.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="aud_music" id="aud_music_select" style="nav-up: #tab_audio">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-debug__select-wrapper config-option__list" data-if="aud_music == 1">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Custom volume: {{aud_custom_volume}}%</div><div class="config-tip-text">How loud custom files play, as a share of the game's music volume, so a loud library can be brought level with the game's own music (which is not affected). Applies straight away, to the track playing too.</div></div>
                                        <input
                                            class="nav-vert"
                                            id="aud_custom_volume_input"
                                            type="range"
                                            data-value="aud_custom_volume"
                                            min="10"
                                            max="100"
                                            step="5"
                                        />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Sound effects</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Shuffle sound effects</div><div class="config-tip-text">Every one of the game's 70 sound effects becomes a different one, the same swap for the whole session and a new draw on each launch. Menus, footsteps, spells, hits and all. Any sound still going three seconds after it started is cut, so a looping ambience that lands on a common sound cannot run on.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="aud_sfx_shuffle" id="aud_sfx_shuffle_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option" data-if="aud_music == 1">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Tracks</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" style="margin-bottom: 8dp;">
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_music_random_all:custom">Randomise all (Custom only)</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_music_random_all:own">Randomise all (Game's own)</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_music_random_all:mix">Randomise all (Mix)</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_stop_preview">Stop preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" data-if="aud_library_count == 0">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 14dp; width: 100%;"><div>No .seq files in the custom_music folder</div></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" data-if="aud_library_big > 0">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 14dp; width: 100%;"><div>{{aud_library_big}} file(s) over 32 KB are not offered</div></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="aud-picker" data-if="aud_picker_track >= 0">
                                        <div class="aud-picker__title">Choose for: {{aud_picker_label}}</div>
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                            <input type="text" id="aud_filter_input" data-value="aud_filter" maxlength="60" style="width: 320dp;" />
                                            <button class="button aud-play" data-event-click="aud_pick(-1)">Game's own</button>
                                            <button class="button aud-play" data-event-click="aud_pick(-2)">Cancel</button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="aud-picker__list">
                                            <button class="button aud-choice" data-for="name, i : aud_filtered" data-event-click="aud_pick(i)">{{name}}</button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" style="margin-top: 6dp;">
                                            <button class="button aud-play" data-event-click="aud_picker_turn(-1)">Previous</button>
                                            <button class="button aud-play" data-event-click="aud_picker_turn(1)">Next</button>
                                            <div class="aud-picker__note" style="margin: 0dp 0dp 0dp 12dp;">{{aud_picker_page}}</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="aud-picker__note">Type to search; 60 matches a page.</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Title screen</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 27: Title screen. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(27)">{{aud_track_27_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:27">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Battle</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 13: Battle. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(13)">{{aud_track_13_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:13">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Boss battle</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 0: Boss battle. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(0)">{{aud_track_0_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:0">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Mammon battle</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 41: Mammon battle. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(41)">{{aud_track_41_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:41">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Victory fanfare</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 43: Victory fanfare. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(43)">{{aud_track_43_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:43">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Death</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 30: Death. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(30)">{{aud_track_30_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:30">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Credits</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 20: Credits. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(20)">{{aud_track_20_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:20">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Melrode Monastery</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 15: Melrode Monastery. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(15)">{{aud_track_15_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:15">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Melrode</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 2: Melrode. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(2)">{{aud_track_2_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:2">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 14dp;" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Churches, halls and Mammon's World</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 33: Churches, halls and Mammon's World. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(33)">{{aud_track_33_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:33">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Buildings</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 7: Buildings (shops, inns, houses). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(7)">{{aud_track_7_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:7">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Fields</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 21: Fields (Holy Plains, Dondoran Flats, West Carmagh, West Limelin). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(21)">{{aud_track_21_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:21">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Dondoran</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 25: Dondoran. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(25)">{{aud_track_25_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:25">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Dondoran Castle</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 3: Dondoran Castle. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(3)">{{aud_track_3_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:3">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Connor Forest</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 35: Connor Forest. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(35)">{{aud_track_35_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:35">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Forests</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 24: Forests (Connor, Glencoe, Windward). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(24)">{{aud_track_24_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:24">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Forests</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 12: Forests (inner paths). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(12)">{{aud_track_12_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:12">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Larapool</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 34: Larapool. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(34)">{{aud_track_34_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:34">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Blue Cave</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 23: Blue Cave. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(23)">{{aud_track_23_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:23">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Blue Cave</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 9: Blue Cave (inner). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(9)">{{aud_track_9_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:9">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Blue Cave</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 11: Blue Cave (deep). Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <button class="button aud-name" data-event-click="aud_open_picker(11)">{{aud_track_11_name}}</button>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:11">Preview</button>
                                    </div>
