                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Cull Hazard</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 10: Cull Hazard. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
