                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 14dp;" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Hidden rooms and shrines</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 6: Hidden rooms and shrines. Click the name to choose a file; Preview starts the track now, as set here.</div></div>
